{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地有人造謠以25萬元人民幣，售出藝人肖戰演唱會第一排門票，被公安拘留。</p><p></p><p>肖戰下月初將在上海、南京舉行演唱會，門票首輪開售後迅速售罄，有黃牛為招攬生意，在網上發布信息，宣稱第一排門票以25萬元售出，官方票務平台隨即報警。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ARTIST 2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202631AtKo0F4o1792586242.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>當局指涉事黃牛行為嚴重擾亂公共秩序，違反治安管理處罰法，將其拘留7日，並罰款1,000元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:41:29.100657+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T14:17:51.074445+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:37:45.270270+00:00","content_hash":"0cf7ec20ae35543ee9e12ae1529251e99cdfc64b7d2795e13a10ce0a4211a027","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}